From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mocking: depend on the protobuf target with Meson 1.4

SteamOS ships Meson 1.4, whose custom_target(depends:) does not accept a
CustomTargetIndex. The target itself preserves the same generation ordering.
This does not change the installed sensor library or its protocol.

--- a/mocking/ssc_server/meson.build
+++ b/mocking/ssc_server/meson.build
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@
     install: true,
     install_dir: [join_paths(python.get_install_dir(), 'ssc_server')]
   )
-  python_gen += protobuf_python_gen[0]
+  python_gen += protobuf_python_gen
 endforeach
 
 # Make the SSC Server available during tests
